flowchart LR
  API[FastAPI request] --> Verify[Verify Supabase JWT]
  Verify --> Identity[claims.sub]
  Identity --> Ordinary{Operation class}
  Ordinary -->|User-owned| UserToken[Caller-token client]
  UserToken --> RLS[Postgres RLS and Storage policy]
  RLS --> UserData[(User rows and objects)]
  Ordinary -->|Privileged worker| Guard[Independent authorization and audit]
  Guard --> Secret[Isolated service credential or privileged RPC]
  Secret --> WorkerData[(Moderation, queues, cleanup, deletion)]
  Identity --> CrossCheck[X-Student-Id cross-check only]
  Local[(Local cache, indexes, leases)] --> Erasure[User deletion hook]
  UserData --> Erasure
  Erasure --> Receipt[Resumable deletion receipt]
